        <h2 id="ancDelux">Deluxe</h2>
        <p>Western-style (2 to 4-person occupancy)</p>
        <div class="l-block w410">
          <dl>
                <dt class="ttl">Facilities</dt>
                <dd>Unit bath, toilet with warm water bidet, basin, digital television, refrigerator, balcony with wood deck, alarm clock, tea set (coffee, green tea, black tea), kettle</dd>
                <dt class="ttl">Amenities</dt>
                <dd>Bathroom (body shampoo, shampoo/conditioner, bath towel, towel) Amenities (toothbrush, ladies set, folding hairbrush, washing ball, beauty kit (facial washing supplies and lotions)), adult nightwear, slippers</dd>
          </dl>
        </div>
        <p class="r-photo"><a href="/route/kobe-oita/cabin/img/img-delux01-b.jpg" class="gallery"><img src="/route/kobe-oita/cabin/img/img-delux01-m.jpg" width="300" height="200" alt=""></a></p>
        <hr>

        <h2 id="ancStandard">Standard</h2>
        <div class="l-block w410">
          <p>Western-style (1 to 4-person occupancy)</p>
          <dl>
                <dt class="ttl">Facilities</dt>
                <dd>Basin, digital television, bunk bed</dd>
                <dt class="ttl">Amenities</dt>
                <dd>Hangers, toothbrush, towel, slippers, adult nightwear</dd>
          </dl>
        </div>
        <p class="r-photo"><a href="/route/kobe-oita/cabin/img/img-standard01-b.jpg" class="gallery"><img src="/route/kobe-oita/cabin/img/img-standard01-m.jpg" width="300" height="200" alt=""></a></p>
        
        
        <hr>
        <h2 id="ancWithPet">Room that accommodates  pets (dog and/or cat)</h2>
        <div class="l-block w410">
          <p>Western-style (4-person occupancy) or Western-style (double-occupancy)</p>
          <dl>
            <dt class="ttl">Facilities</dt>
            <dd>Basin, digital television, bunk bed</dd>
            <dt class="ttl">Amenities</dt>
            <dd>Hangers, toothbrush, towel, slippers, adult nightwear</dd>
          </dl>
        </div>
        <p class="r-photo"><a href="/route/kobe-oita/cabin/img/img-withpet01-b.jpg" class="gallery"><img src="/route/kobe-oita/cabin/img/img-withpet01-m.jpg" width="300" height="200" alt=""></a></p>
        <hr>
        <h2 id="ancPrivate">Private bed</h2>
        <div class="l-block w410">
          <p>All seats reserved</p>
          <dl>
            <dt class="ttl">Facilities</dt>
            <dd>Bed light, electric outlet, lifejacket</dd>
            <dt class="ttl">Amenities</dt>
            <dd><p>towel, earphones, toothbrush, slippers</p>
            </dd>
          </dl>
        </div>
        <p class="r-photo"><a href="/route/kobe-oita/cabin/img/img-private01-b.jpg?" class="gallery"><img src="/route/kobe-oita/cabin/img/img-private01-m.jpg" width="300" height="200" alt=""></a></p>
        
        <hr>
        <h2 id="ancTourist">Tourist</h2>
        <div class="l-block w410">
          <p>Japanese-style, All seats reserved</p>
          <dl>
            <dt class="ttl">Facilities</dt>
